 "process": "every device process under a plain `timeout 10` (no -k, no -s): `sparsity_host ... --seconds 6 --budget 7.5`; a host alive 30 s after it started gets SIGTERM on its wrapper, never SIGKILL; alive 30 s later it is a LEFTOVER: the session ends, makes no closing read, and holds the card's lock until no device process of its login is left (E208's step 10); never a reset",
